WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:06.360
What nonsense the imperial seal has always been in the Sikong family's hands go back and tell Shilang.

00:06.440 --> 00:09.987
If he's willing to bare his back and carry thorns and surrender to Great Xuan.

